nt go into exile</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1952</span><span class="rf-text">The High Authority of the European <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/coal">Coal</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/steel">Steel</a> Community settles in Luxembourg</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1985</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/schengen-agreement">Schengen Agreement</a> is signed at the village of Schengen</span></li></ol>
